6. She overcame her fear enough to ride two extreme roller coasters in Japan despite intense anxiety. (Verbatim: "I went on this, I went on this... I did it, I was really happy I did it, like, okay, here we go...")
7. One of the roller coasters she rode was once the world's tallest and had the largest drop in the world at 70 meters. (Verbatim: "It was the world's tallest roller coaster, once upon a time, it's not anymore, and it had the largest drop in the world, so it's at 70 meters.")
8. She kept her eyes open during the ride despite extreme fear, which she considered a personal victory. (Verbatim: "I actually kept my eyes open as well, I kept my eyes open, this was the one where I kept my eyes open.")
9. She has a sibling named Ellie Bro, with whom she plans to collaborate on a future project. (Verbatim: "On my donathon one of the rewards was a collab with my brother...")
10. She has a history of being organized and maintaining lists for upcoming content and events. (Verbatim: "I actually have a list I'm working through... I sent out emails today regarding stuff I've not forgotten about...") [end of text]



